    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ompö könyi taman nko mut nyo pö paytaghpa Kaisari Tiperio, ki pöytoghinto Yudea Pontio Pilato, kï ki pöytoghinto Kalilaya Erode, aki pöytoghinto Iturea nko Trakoniti werïngwa Pilipo, kï ki pöytoghinto Apilene Lusani ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akï tïsï cho echön Anas nko Kayapa. Kingwïnchï atoni ngölyonto Tororöt Yoana Wero Sakaria ompö surkwen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kïlenyona kïwestotö Yoana kïghömï okumpö Yordan, kwomchini pich lö, “Okötenö ngokikwo tökepatisanak, atökïlöstewok Tororöt ngokikwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.40.3+ISA.40.4+ISA.40.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Isa 40:3-5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kile wölo kikikirta ompö kitapu werkoyon Isaya lö,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.3.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
